<title>SPAIN: Spain's 10-yr bond yield falls under US notes'.</title>
<headline>Spain's 10-yr bond yield falls under US notes'.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish 10-year bond yields have fallen below the yield on 10-year U.S. notes, dealers said after the opening on Friday.</p>
<p>Soon after the Spanish-US spread widened to minus three basis points.</p>
<p>At the same time, around 0940 GMT, the yield spread over Bunds was at 90 basis points.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
